          "text": "Sure, it's Alicia Romero.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. And this is for a residential property, right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, it's my home. It's a house in Marine Park.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. What's the house number and street?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "It's 2214 Avenue U, Brooklyn, 11229.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Is it completely out, or just not keeping up?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "It's completely out. The furnace isn't running at all, and the thermostat is reading 62 degrees.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Since when has it been out?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Since last night. It was working fine during the day yesterday, then it just stopped heating in the evening.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "What's the best phone number to reach you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I'm calling from (332) 555-0121, so that number works.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "So that's twenty-two fourteen Avenue U, and the number you're calling from, ending in zero one two one. That's all correct, right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, that's all correct.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "The soonest I have is today, 11:30 to 12. If anything makes this more urgent for you, just let me know. Does that work?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, today from 11:30 to 12 works for me.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Will you be able to approve any repair work the technician recommends?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I'm not sure yet what the technician will recommend, but yes, I should be able to approve the repair if it's reasonable. Would it help if I told you what I've already tried?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Yes, that would help. What have you already tried?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I changed the thermostat batteries, but that didn't do anything. Nothing else has been tried yet.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Will someone be home to let the technician in?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, someone is home all day. It's two healthy adults, and there are no pets.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Is there a gate code or a buzzer the technician should know about?",
